$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for the One-Pot Synthesis of
Substituted 2-Aminothiophenes 3 A mixture of carbonyl compound (3.0
mmol), nitrile (3.3 mmol), sulfur (4.5 mmol), L-proline (0.3 mmol), and
DMF (3.0 mL) in a 50 mL round bottom flask was stirred at 60°C for 10-24
h. The crude product was directly purified through flash chromatography.
The desired product 3. 6-tert-Butyl 3-ethyl 2-amin
-4,5-dihydrothieno[2,3-c]pyridine-3,6(7H)-dicarboxylate (Table 2, entry
7) [4] 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 6.03 (bs, 2H), 4.35 (s, 2H), 4.27(q,
J = 8.0 and 16.0 Hz, 2H), 3.62 (t, J = 4.0 Hz, 2H), 2.81 (s, 2H), 1.48
(s, 9H), 1.34 (t, J = 4.0 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 165.7,
162.7, 154.6, 131.3, 113.6, 104.7, 79.9, 59.5, 42.7, 40.5, 28.4, 27.1,
14.4; MS (EI) m/z 326 (M+), 269 (100 %).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Gewald reaction
